A glossy cyan icon in the [[frutiger-aero|Frutiger Aero]] style, with a soft gradient fill and a thick rounded outline. OpenDB uses it on the `{{unreferenced}}` and `{{more citations}}` templates, for entries that need sources. A smaller copy is used on the site itself.
